  "qualifications": [
    "hint-light-dismiss-order: light dismiss of an open auto popover and hint popover fires beforetoggle on the auto popover first natively and on the hint first in Chromium; the fixture asserts each backend order.",
    "close-watcher-activation: a close request cancel is cancelable only with history-action user activation; the fixture gives both engines a trusted click first, and both report the Escape cancel cancelable.",
    "toggle-before-close: on the close-request path native fires toggle before close and Chromium close before toggle; the fixture compares queued events per element without order.",
    "coalesced-toggles (unordered): a pending toggle task absorbs the next toggle, so queued toggles compare by per-element close count, last newState and an oldState chain, never by count.",
    "A popover of a replaced document stays :popover-open in that document (native lifetime check).",
    "Win-x64 only; Linux and macOS not run locally."
